6. Active, known or suspected autoimmune diseases (patients with vitiligo who do not require systematic treatment within 2 years before the first study of drug therapy are allowed to be enrolled;Patients with hypothyroidism requiring only thyroid hormone replacement therapy, type 1 diabetes requiring only insulin replacement therapy, and patients with pituitary inflammation and adrenocortical dysfunction requiring only physiological hormone replacement therapy can be enrolled);
7. Hiv-infected patients;
